.TH "RAPTOR-ESTIMATE" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-estimate \- Time a short pilot and predict the wall\-clock time for N runs.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor estimate\fR [\-h] [\-n N] [\-t T] [\-f {text,json}] MODEL
.SH DESCRIPTION
Time a short pilot and predict the wall\-clock time for N runs.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-runs\fR \fIN\fR

.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-length\fR \fIT\fR

.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI{text|json}\fR

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
